  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "覚悟のない欲望ってつまらないと思うわ  (Half-Hearted Desires Are Boring)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "reika": "麗華",
    "megumi": "恵美",
