  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Across town on a sunlit university lawn, sheltered college student Megumi Sahara listens as her classmates tease her for not having a boyfriend—before turning the tables with an unexpected question. Listen to Megumi and her friends in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ねえ恵美、こないだのディスコの彼はどう？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ううん、別に何もないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "恵美もそろそろ恋人ぐらい作ればいいのに。ちょっと奥手すぎるんじゃない？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そうだよ、男の子紹介しようか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ねえ、二人はどうなの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "まあね、相性とかはすげえいいよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ちょっと何言ってんの？もうやめてよ、恥ずかしい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "でも、演技かもしれないよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そんなわけないだろ！何だよ、そうなの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "私はつまらないな、演技だとしたら。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "じゃあ、先に教室に戻るね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "覚悟のない欲望って、つまらないと思うわ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ねえ恵美、こないだのディスコの彼はどう？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey Megumi, how did things go with that guy from the disco the other night?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ううん、別に何もないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing — nothing happened at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "恵美もそろそろ恋人ぐらい作ればいいのに。ちょっと奥手すぎるんじゃない？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's high time you got yourself a boyfriend too — aren't you being way too shy?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そうだよ、男の子紹介しようか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She's right — want me to introduce you to a guy?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ねえ、二人はどうなの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, what about the two of you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "まあね、相性とかはすげえいいよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, our chemistry together is honestly amazing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ちょっと何言ってんの？もうやめてよ、恥ずかしい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, what are you blurting out?! Stop it already, that's embarrassing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "でも、演技かもしれないよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, she might just be acting, mightn't she?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そんなわけないだろ！何だよ、そうなの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No way that's true! Wait a second — is it?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "私はつまらないな、演技だとしたら。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Personally, I'd find it awfully dull if it were just an act.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "じゃあ、先に教室に戻るね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, I'll head back to the classroom ahead of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "覚悟のない欲望って、つまらないと思うわ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Desire without true resolve is boring, I think.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
